# isoloom targets
✗ hybrid (machine `block` has several addresses on `office`: a container has one address per network (Docker and Kubernetes give an endpoint one IPv4 address); run it on a VM target (its `os`, and `app.steps` for an app))

# isoloom generate --target hybrid (exit 1)
· hybrid: machine `block` has several addresses on `office`: a container has one address per network (Docker and Kubernetes give an endpoint one IPv4 address); run it on a VM target (its `os`, and `app.steps` for an app)
